"""Selective word-class and short-phrase approximation.

Selected quantifiers, concessive connectives, and help/evaluation words receive
positive values. All/both, obligation, use, and control/dependence words receive
negative ones. Document-initial Can/Could and 'how can/could' receive much
larger positive values; 'unable/failed to' is another positive phrase.
Formatting has a few literal cases. Everything else defaults to -0.002.
Only the preceding token and document boundary are remembered. This does not
model the component's many other word-specific and contextual responses.
