"""Summation detector for layer-0 MLP unit 438.

The unit reads the word "sum" (any case, with or without a leading space, or as part of an
identifier such as `_sum` or `.sum`) and fires strongly on it, about 5 nats. It also fires
on the "of" in "sum of" (about 3.6), on the summation sign Σ (about 3.4), and weakly
(about 0.8) on words for other aggregates: total, count, product, difference, average,
mean, integral. The "summ-" words (summary, summer, summit) fire a little (about 1).
Everywhere else it is about 0.
